  "narrative": {
    "text": "A GitHub organisation audit-log screenshot. The search box holds the query action:org.update_actions_secret, and two matching events are listed: the octobot account updated the secrets EXAMPLE_TOKEN and DEMO_SERVICE_PROVIDER_CREDENTIALS, each made available to selected repositories of octo-org via the API, each with a country, a source IP address and '50 minutes ago', and a collapsed 'View token details'. It illustrates that a change to an Actions secret is an auditable event attributed to an actor and an origin.",
